<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<class name="VehicleController" inherits="Resource" api_type="extension" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd">
	<brief_description>
		Base train controller controlling all train systems
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		Base train controller node.
		It allows building behaviour of the train by adding child nodes of the [VehicleComponent] class.
		The vehicle holds its own commands and is reached by its [RailVehicleServer] handle;
		[member train_id] is only its scenery name, registered with [method RailVehicleServer.vehicle_set_name].
	</description>
